OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans meet to mark start of
OL,4,ARemembrance period
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of veterans came together to
OL,7,Fmark the start of the Remembrance
OL,8,Fperiod and Poppy Appeal.
OL,10,FThe Royal British Legion Guernsey flag
OL,11,Fwas raised on the mast at the bottom of
OL,12,FSt Julian's Avenue, Guernsey, to
OL,13,Fcommemorate on Thursday. There was also
OL,14,Fa service to dedicate the Field of
OL,15,FRemembrance at the War Memorial in St
OL,16,FPeter Port.
OL,18,FBen Rowe, president of the Royal
OL,19,FBritish Legion in Guernsey, said:
OL,20,F"We've got to remember our history.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
